Subject: [PATCH 02/10] hw/misc: imx6ul_ccm: Update PMU_MISC0 reset value

---
 hw/misc/imx6ul_ccm.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/hw/misc/imx6ul_ccm.c b/hw/misc/imx6ul_ccm.c
